    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43924" root="&#xA;                        نزل&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            6
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَازَلَ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He descended gradually, by little
and little.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنازل إِلَى أَحَدٍ</span>
                        <i>He humbled himself,
condescended, to one.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنازل عَنِ المُلْكِ</span>
                        <i>He
abdicated the kingdom.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنازل عَن شَىْءٍ</span>
                        <i>He
desisted from a thing.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَازَلُوا</span>
                        <i>They alighted
and ate by turns with different people; i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَاوَبُوا</span>, q. v.

